e to serve the ordinary people (Sa 1966:29)" "During the Zhou dynasty (1134-256 BC) onward, merchants\' guilds based on family relationships came into being in China (Chuan 1978)." However, before the Sui and Tang, "merchants could open stores only in restricted locations, and merchant guilds were localized."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2537, 'temperature': 0.2})
